# Build context trim for the compose images. The server image needs
# pyproject.toml, uv.lock, packages/, scripts/, deploy/. The frontend image is
# built from the repo root because Vite imports two shared JS assets from
# packages/agent-server. Keep local state/secrets out of every image context.

# --- heavy / irrelevant ---
.git
.venv
node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.hypothesis
.mypy_cache
.coverage
htmlcov

# --- local runtime state + SECRETS (never ship these) ---
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
disco-config.json
disco-config.json.*
*.bak-*
secrets.json
*secret*
.env
.env.*

# --- developer scratch / harness / captured runs (not needed at runtime) ---
.orchestrate
agent-projects
test-record
review-queue
bakeoff
harness
evals
prompts
run_manual*.py
test_*.py
*.csv
validation_output.txt
validate.py

# --- docs (the image doesn't serve them) ---
*.md
docs
